    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'This pizza has been in here SINCE THE 25TH. EAT IT or THROW IT OUT. Nobody
    is coming back for it.

    There is a turkey in there too and that is GENE''S
    BIRTHDAY TURKEY. Have some respect. The man only turns 52 once. Leave it.'
