--- !u!114 &485378098
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 485378096}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 38732f8ed70b08f86b6401a11fceb82d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GlorifiedBody.Interaction.Broadcast
  roomId: R1
  lines:
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_00
    text: ...in uniform for the first time this morning, one week after that vote,
      and the new name is the Japan Strategic Self Defense Forces, the JSSDF, you're
      going to be hearing that one a lot.
    picture: a parade under gray sky, new flags
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_01
    text: Meanwhile Washington is sending a third carrier group to the region, and
      we're told American forces there remain on high alert.
    picture: a carrier at sea, aircraft on the deck
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_02
    text: This as we're learning of more reports that North Korea has supplied nuclear
      material to armed groups. Pyongyang denies it, and we should say none of those
      reports is confirmed at this hour.
    picture: a map of the region, the border drawn red
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_03
    text: Closer to home, the police strike enters its fifth straight day. The union
      walked out over pay and pensions, and talks broke down again last night with
      no new session on the calendar.
    picture: a picket line in the snow, outside a precinct house
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_04
    text: So for one more morning it's the National Guard, checkpoints on the bridges
      and the expressway, and yes, give yourself extra time getting into the city.
    picture: a Guard checkpoint on a bridge, a barrier, a line of cars
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_05
    text: The mayor is calling it a season of patience. Down on Market Street, lights
      up, sidewalks empty, the shop owners we talked to are calling it something
      else.
    picture: a shop window with its Christmas lights, an empty sidewalk
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_06
    text: And the Guard says those checkpoints stay through New Year's Eve and the
      anniversary, so plan accordingly tonight.
    picture: a checkpoint at night, the city lights behind it
  byBand:
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_07
    text: And finally this morning, an incident overnight at the Winwood Reade Memorial,
      that's out past the city line. Officials aren't saying much, there's no word
      on a motive, and police want to question a woman.
    picture: the gates of the Memorial at dawn, a patrol car
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_08
    text: And finally this morning, a shooter attacked the Winwood Reade Memorial
      overnight, that's out past the city line. [N] people are dead, the motive is
      unknown, and the woman police want should not be approached.
    picture: the gates of the Memorial at dawn, tape across them
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_09
    text: And finally this morning, [N] people are dead after a shooter attacked
      the Winwood Reade Memorial overnight, that's out past the city line. The motive
      is unknown, no group has claimed it, and the woman police want should not be
      approached.
    picture: the gates of the Memorial at dawn, tape across them, a line of ambulances
  closing:
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_10
    text: Police describe her as about twenty, slim, very pale, long curly light
      blonde hair, and gold-colored lines on the skin at the neck and the joints,
      tattoos or paint, nobody's sure.
    picture: the anchor at the desk
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_11
    text: She was seen in a white one-piece bodysuit, or in a hospital security uniform,
      that's gray-blue, gray vest, white reflective bands.
    picture: the anchor at the desk
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_12
    text: She was last seen leaving the Memorial through the parking lot toward the
      river road, and police believe she's changed clothes since and covered her
      face.
    picture: the Memorial parking lot, the river road beyond it
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_13
    text: Police say they know who she is, they've released this photo from her ID,
      and we're showing it now.
    picture: 'PLACEHOLDER: her ID photo, full screen'
  - speaker: TV
    id: n1b_14
    text: Police are asking citizens to be on the lookout for -
    picture: 
  doneFlag: demo_r1_news_done
  loop: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5783183b3f71a3f91911c014ba8e0d14, type: 3}
  loopVolume: 0.2
  pictures: {fileID: 485378099}
  afterComment: '[A music channel. A Christmas song, low.]'
