    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "STAFF HANDBOOK\nSection 9 \u2014 Staff Areas\n9.1 Personal celebrations
    in staff areas (a birthday, a retirement, a new baby) are welcome. Please keep
    them to the break rooms and the staff cafeteria, be considerate of colleagues
    who are on shift, and clean up after yourselves when you are done.\n9.2 Religious
    observance has its place in the Memorial chapel, which is open to all staff at
    all hours. We ask that it be kept there rather than in the staff areas.\nQuestions
    about this section may be directed to Human Resources."
